  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.<br>• Slice zucchini into half-moons. <br>• Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks.<br>TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-559b3700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic &amp; herb seasoning and toss to coat.<br>• Place beetroot and zucchini on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.<br>• Roast pumpkin and veggies until tender, 25-30 minutes. Allow veggies to cool slightly.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-07f02410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine ciabatta chunks, savoury seasoning and a good drizzle of olive oil.<br>• In the last 7 minutes of cook time, place ciabatta on the tray with the veggies. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.<br>• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine fetta cubes and Greek-style yoghurt and mash to combine. Season to taste. oghurt and mash to combine. Season.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-22b5fd20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When veggies and croutons have cooled slightly, add mixed salad leavesand balsamic vinaigrette dressing to the beetroot and zucchini tray. Toss to coat.<br>• Divide veggie salad between bowls, then top with garlicky pumpkin.<br>• Spoon over fetta yoghurt. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-1c847830.jpg"
    }
  ]
